  "texts": {
    "preamble": "R.Govindarajan vs The Commissioner Of Food Safety And Drug ... on 1 August, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.220 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 01.08.2024 Coram: The Honourable Mr. Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.22088 of 2024 and WMP.Nos.24073 & 24074 of 2024 R.Govindarajan ... P Vs The Commissioner of Food Safety and Drug Administration, O/o. the Commissioner of Food Safety and Drug Administration, Dms Campus, Annasalai, Chennai 600 006 ..... Respondent Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of Constitution praying for the issuance of a Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus calli the records pertaining to the impugned order of transfer in R.No.39 2024/S12/FSD, dated 19.07.2024 on the file of the respondent and qu the same as illegal and consequently to direct the respondent to fr general transfer guidelines and then conduct the transfer counselin necessary for transfers among the Food Safety Officers in Tamilnadu within the time stipulated by this Court. For Petitioner : Mr.S.Louis For Respondent : Mrs.M.Sneha, Special Counsel for Health D 1/6 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.No.2 ORDER R.Govindarajan vs The Commissioner Of Food Safety And Drug ... on 1 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/118829256/ 1",
    "facts": "2. The petitioner was appointed as Sanitary Inspector in the year 1993 and was posted at Coimbatore City Municipal Corporation. From the year 2011, he was shifted to the newly created department called, Tamil Nadu State Food Safety and Drug Administration Department in the cadre of Food Safety Officer and he was posted at Coimbatore City Municipal Corporation.",
    "arguments": "The respondent failed to frame any Rules so far for the Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department."
  },
