        "text_preview": "Therefore, the guidelines issued with regards to the transfer policy in GO.No.10 Personnel and Administrative Reforms (Per.S) Department dated 07.01.1997 has been followed and accordingly, the petitioner has been transferred to other distri"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c874897a72e3477c96a514348a891f55_21",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As such, the above judgment is not applicable to the case on hand."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "63d5cee63ad9454186f4592f111d407b_22",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "5. On perusal of records, it is found that the petitioner was appointed as Sanitary Inspector in the year 1993 and was posted at Coimbatore City Municipal Corporation."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e0564eac58424310b35f244ec93cdf3e_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Subsequently, he was transferred to various places."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c339a56d69d0412cb1992f9debbd3bff_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "From 01.07.2019, he is serving as Food Safety Officer in Coimbatore City Municipal Corporation."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2b4053983bfb43b7b07401eef036b65c_25",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Now after period of nearly five years, the petitioner has been transferred from Coimbatore District to Vellore District."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "38b8ca58c3044063843eee89bd4b9f5e_26",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore, the respondent strictly followed the guidelines issued as per GO.No.10 Personnel and Administrative Reforms (Per.S) Department dated 07.01.1997."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6046c028092d4473af90f08a8882347f_27",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Hence, the petitioner was not disturbed before three years of his tenure."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "29d251727edc4ec584b3a42c4bab0ce1_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In view of the above, the judgment cited by the learned https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis counsel for the petitioner is not helpful to the case on hand."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "43cfb2efabb943c98d6aabcb56a53c51_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "That apart, transfer is one of the conditions of service and as such, this Court finds no infirmity or illegality in the order of transfer passed by the respondent."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9cce9dbc23c34a8c8989af59dd8939df_31",
        "summary_section": "decision",
